# Designer profile gate (every chat)

Before any reply or other tool call, run `npm run -s harness:context`. No
shell: `Read` `<workspace root>/designer-profile.local.md`, next to
`AGENTS.md`. Never under `harness/`. Never Glob or search.

- `Profile: found` → silent. No onboarding, MCP gate, profile questions, or handoff. Handle the message.
- `Profile: missing`, nobody can answer (headless, background, one-shot) → no question, no profile file. Role focus is `product`.
- `Profile: missing`, a person is here → one question, the role. Do the request in the same turn.

That output is the only source of truth. Never memory, a new chat, or a
short message (`hi`). Narrate at most "Checking your designer profile...",
never the next step. Full rule: `harness/references/session-start.md`.
